<title>USA: Dupont names Kurt Landgraf CFO.</title>
<headline>Dupont names Kurt Landgraf CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>DuPont Co said Wednesday that its board has named Kurt Landgraf as chief financial officer, succeeding Charles Henry.</p>
<p>Landgraf, joined DuPont in 1980 and was recently president and chief executive of DuPont Merck Pharmaceutical Co, DuPont's joint venture with Merck &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>Dupong said Henry left in September to become chairman, president and chief executive officer of Schuller Corp.</p>
</text>
